## At the end of a sprint

Run an after-action review of the sprint, then file each gap you found in the skills with the [sprint-feedback form](https://github.com/CUPIDS-Lab/data-skills/issues/new?template=sprint-feedback.yml), against the Outline section numbers in `ROADMAP.md`. Private projects report process lessons only: no data, names or record details.
